{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Validate inline envelopes through the offloader's load path.** Caching the pre-offload `serialized` value bypasses the envelope's inline data and `load` behavior. An inline offloader that transforms data\u2014or accidentally returns data inconsistent with its digest\u2014can succeed initially but deserialize differently or fail after replay. Let normal resolution load and validate the envelope, and add a fresh-codec replay test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7odJdQ","finding_digest":"8ab2fa5ee5fd8177ef72b64724a2d0ec107d6efd21f9ac74ec2a995c08dbc9ca","finding_id":"arf_v1_rkzpuxxf7waxp33swzdsjiwq5q","finding_key":"sdk/execution/payloadcodec::serialize::inline-replay-equivalence","identity_key":"sdk/execution/payloadcodec::serialize::inline-replay-equivalence","line":93,"observation_digest":"3b90179f98ade84180d22e6f1eebf9d840bcca974c5a12b28ec54288c574e9b5","observation_id":"aro_v1_hoibph4yvxuedagsfzxr527z3b","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/PayloadCodec.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-01T01:31:53Z","review_id":"arr_v1_vlvjn3k2bg6cxoepbwrwc2slgw","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"88bc34d2d082149d899d22adc7327b4f4d12ef4c","reviewer":"codex","start_line":91,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_r5xxhuwp2natgbgcxrp3or5zfk"},"pull_request":{"number":649},"record_id":"art_v1_oo6pmn7nyr6bsd7xct3fxnwrf7","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T01:31:53Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
